# Database

- PostgreSQL + EF Core 10. snake_case table names.
- UUID keys, UTC timestamps, `xmin` row versions, soft delete where configured.
- Index user-scoped lists and occurrence uniqueness.
- Never auto-migrate as a hidden side effect in production deploys without a release step (local/dev may migrate on startup).
- Do not expand schema for SMS/WhatsApp/OCR until those features are in scope.
